  42: The ten changed labels are F4, F12, F13, F16, F17, F24, F25, D2, D3 and D7. The quoted proof line is [REPAIR3.c.txt:999](C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/wdc473floor/repair3_20261013/REPAIR3.c.txt:999).
